  m_Name: 1 - Instructions
  m_EditorClassIdentifier: UtilityScriptIWrite::HintSO
  hintId: tutorial_instruction
  isUnlockedByDefault: 0
  ignoreLock: 0
  title: Instructions
  image: {fileID: 0}
  description: '<b>Instructions</b>


    A program is made from multiple instructions
    executed one at a time from top to bottom.


    Each line of code is considered
    an instruction.


    Example:


    moveForward()

    turnLeft()

    collect()


    When
    the robot starts executing a program, it follows the instructions in order exactly
    as written.


    Changing the order of instructions can produce completely different
    results.


    Learning how instructions flow step-by-step is an important foundation
    in programming and problem solving.'
  isImageBig: 0
